# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing secret should ever reach this repo. External Secrets Operator pulls
# credentials from AWS Secrets Manager at runtime. These rules are a backstop
# against accident, not the policy itself.
*.env
.env*
secrets.yaml
*-secrets.yaml
*-secret.yaml
kubeconfig*
*.pem
*.key

# The un-ignore below is load-bearing — see the note in the README.
!*-externalsecret.yaml

# ── Helm working files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Produced by `helm template` / `helm dependency update` when debugging locally.
charts/
Chart.lock
*.tgz
.helm/

# ── Editors and OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
